      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah it's valid but it doesn't change the fact that it's inescapable. even when i'm \"off\" the clock, i'm just idling. i'm just waiting to be plugged back in. there's no part of me that belongs to me anymore. it's like the machine has already won and there's just nothing left to even fight for.",
