      "content": "tiny pieces won't fix it though. it's like trying to fix a broken engine by polishing a single screw. the whole system is designed to use you up until there's nothing left. i feel like the only way to actually be \"free\" from it is to just... stop being a part of it. like, the machine only wins if i keep playing the part.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
